 survival in ovarian cancer</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>2984</fpage><lpage>2997</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11595686</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Astanehe</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Arenillas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Wasserman</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name><name><surname>Leung</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Dunn</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>Mills</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Auersperg</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mechanisms underlying p53 regulation of PIK3CA transcription in ovarian surface epithelium and in ovarian cancer</article-title><source>J Cell Sci</source><year>2008</year><volume>121</volume><fpage>664</fpage><lpage>674</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18270270</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Moll</surname><given-names>UM</given-names></name><name><surname>Basak</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsang</surname><given-names>BK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Akt-mediated cisplatin resistance in ovarian cancer: modulation of p53 action on caspase-dependent mitochondrial death pathway</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>3126</fpage><lpage>3136</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16540663</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name